---
// About FABA, for visitors and members (INFO-01). Prerendered (ADR-001). A draft until the board
// approves it (FND-05).
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

export const prerender = true;
---

<Layout title="About">
  <h1>About FABA</h1>
  <p>
    Faculty Association BYUI Activities (FABA) helps BYU-Idaho faculty find each other outside work: 
    a hike on Saturday, a board game night, lunch with someone from another department. 
    Any faculty member can post an activity in or near Rexburg, and anyone can say "I'm in".
  </p>
  <h2>Who can join</h2>
  <p>
    Faculty with a byui.edu Google account. You sign in with Google, and FABA never sees your
    password. Nothing in FABA is visible to anyone who isn't signed in.
  </p>
  <h2>Who runs it</h2>
  <p>
    The Faculty Association Board runs FABA, and members of the board moderate it. FABA is
    independent of BYU-Idaho. It isn't an official university site or channel, and the university
    doesn't run, review or endorse the activities on it.
  </p>
  <p>
    Read the <a href="/guidelines">community guidelines</a> and the
    <a href="/privacy">privacy notice</a> before you join.
  </p>
</Layout>
